obtain the principal normal vector to the curve at the point where $t=1:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}N(1) & =\\frac{{T}^{′}(1)}{‖{T}^{′}(1)‖}=\\frac{\\frac{2}{5\\sqrt{5}}⟨-2,1⟩}{(\\frac{2}{5})}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}⟨-2,1⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that when we find the scalar product of $N$ and $T$ at the point where $t=1,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}N(1)\\cdot T(1) & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}⟨-2,1⟩\\cdot (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}⟨1,\\,2⟩) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}(⟨-2,1⟩\\cdot ⟨1,\\,2⟩) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}((-2)(1)+(1)(2)) \\\\  & =0.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533473 17592186045585 true] [17592186398312 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398313 13194139533473 17592186045585 true] [17592186398312 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398314 13194139533473 17592186045585 true] [17592186398312 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398315 13194139533473 17592186045585 true] [17592186398312 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398316 13194139533473 17592186045585 true] [17592186398312 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398317 13194139533473 17592186045585 true] [17592186398312 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533473 17592186045585 true] [17592186398312 1077 "selection" 13194139533473 17592186045585 true] [17592186398312 1079 #edb/ref 17592186398315 13194139533473 17592186045585 true] [17592186398312 1080 #uuid "e390087c-f3c4-5e5d-895a-6dad0ea160b5" 13194139533473 17592186045585 true] [17592186398313 1081 "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}⟨1,1⟩" 13194139533473 17592186045585 true] [17592186398313 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533473 17592186045585 true] [17592186398313 1084 #uuid "084dd163-8456-51dc-abdd-4a5eea95cc92" 13194139533473 17592186045585 true] [17592186398314 1081 "⟨-1,0⟩" 13194139533473 17592186045585 true] [17592186398314 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533473 17592186045585 true] [17592186398314 1084 #uuid "a2a7ad62-1f98-5677-b05c-070f0505e36c" 13194139533473 17592186045585 true] [17592186398315 1081 "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}⟨-2,1⟩" 13194139533473 17592186045585 true] [17592186398315 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533473 17592186045